{"items":[{"id":"7690478681508039704","title":"暴君太子突然缠上我","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljL2ZkYTAwNmYwZGQzMmE2MTJhMWZiY2M4ODU2NWJmMWFifnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPWxTUGw3dEswZ1dhbUlIV011Q2tyMzNrUDY3QSUzRHx8MTgyMjEyMjA1Nw\u0026s=dc35ce2545da8041d9c602c57f3ebc58","intro":"前世，太子强娶她，逼得她大婚自尽。带着蚀骨悔恨，重生归来的他收敛戾气，宫宴初见便对她动心撩拨。可她早听说太子残暴，警惕万分，只当他另有所图，当众拒婚。人人都等着看太子震怒，谁知他含笑追问“那要如何，你才肯愿意？”前世的偏执暴君，今生倾尽温柔，可她不敢信，也不愿逃不开这场宿命纠缠。","category":"恋爱","tags":["恋爱","重生","古代"],"remark":"共13集","episode_count":"13","finished":false,"score":"8.6","play_count":"1036"},{"id":"7690421473504152601","title":"家乡的栗子熟了","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljLzIwZTQ0NGJmZWIxMzg4NmU0ZjcyODViOTI3NTAyZGRjfnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPUdkeDkwd084aUpzV0hEa0lIWUNTSDBWOCUyQnhjJTNEfHwxODIyMTIyMDU3\u0026s=455c9fbaf77f296c751efd27ac80faff","intro":"大山里盛产优质板栗，可丰收不等于增收。黑心收购商张老三用口头高价设下圈套，压价、掺假，肆意拿捏淳朴栗农。本村姑娘林小西目睹乡亲年年辛苦却被坑害，挺身而出。从摆摊被恶意打压，到收集证据寻求帮助，联合全村成立板栗合作社，拒绝资本盲目扩张，守住品质与初心。看普通乡村女孩带领村民打破中间商垄断，让一颗颗深山板栗堂堂正正走出大山。没有爽文开挂，只有农民的汗水、挣扎与坚守，见证乡土烟火，读懂耕耘的力量","category":"剧情","tags":["剧情","逆袭","乡村"],"remark":"共17集","episode_count":"17","finished":false,"score":"8.5","play_count":"1003"},{"id":"7690478683168967704","title":"她先站到一线","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljL2VjNzZiMjM3MzViYjM3NTVmNzAzZGRjODlmYTZhYWVjfnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPUFPNG1qN3loc0twV3JGUW5iaTZNbzhLdDQ1USUzRHx8MTgyMjEyMjA1Nw\u0026s=3869b9a831134d89d10298f91c75d6f0","intro":"集团高管沈知遥下沉基层调研，隐瞒身份从一线岗位做起，完整跟随早班流程，亲身复核堵点成因。她不依赖汇报材料，从真实动作中梳理出流程、排班与指标设计的深层问题，推动分层整改，建立常态跟岗机制，让管理决策真正服务现场，实现网点效率与服务质量同步改善。","category":"剧情","tags":["剧情","都市","职场","3D"],"remark":"共30集","episode_count":"30","finished":false,"score":"8.5","play_count":"1004"},{"id":"7690477168261860377","title":"账定同心","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljLzM1NzRlNzgzYmM4NjA5ZTBjYTkzNGUxMjQ0YjJiY2NkfnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPWJFSWl3Nm5RUHFUSEh6Y0ZzTFBLVEdsTkMzQSUzRHx8MTgyMjEyMjA1Nw\u0026s=f16ac79247c1fe07b5751b58f4b9f632","intro":"贺家绸庄内，程玉禾多年操劳家业，功劳却总归于贺家。丈夫贺知衡想要直接给她铺子分成，却被她拒绝。她不愿接受出于补偿的馈赠，坚持凭实际贡献争取名分。夫妻二人围绕账册、权责不断博弈，直面家族质疑与坊间流言，厘清经营边界。这是一段古风家庭经营故事，探讨亲密关系里的尊重与对等，在一笔笔账目间寻得夫妻相处的平衡。","category":"古风世情","tags":["古风世情"],"remark":"共40集","episode_count":"40","finished":false,"score":"8.6","play_count":"1048"},{"id":"7689070127127481368","title":"闯荒年我在古代开电动车逃荒","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljLzUzZTgxMzYyOWIxYTI3YmQ2NDZmZjc4M2QwYzRiNzA2fnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPUVQYUZJUHZneWtXZUV3TEN3eU1hR3c1SVhkbyUzRHx8MTgyMjEyMjA1Nw\u0026s=50847aae1007d0b5a07e26c9a2b45730","intro":"现代女子余思思穿越到灾荒乱世，成为被婆家抛弃的弃妇，还带着襁褓幼女安安。她手握可刷新物资的随身空间，踏上凶险逃荒路。一路上她智斗劫匪、躲避瘟疫，见识饥荒下泯灭的人性，数次死里逃生。途中偶遇真心待她的舅舅一家，众人结伴翻越危机四伏的黑石岭。余思思靠着空间暗中接济亲人，在乱世之中，拼尽全力守护女儿与仅存的亲情，艰难求生。","category":"末世","tags":["末世","穿越","求生","古代","3D"],"remark":"共148集","episode_count":"148","finished":false,"score":"8.4","play_count":"1025"},{"id":"7690157091469675544","title":"三十块以后，我们走散了","cover":"/api/drama/cover?p=aHR0cHM6Ly9wMy1yZWFkaW5nLXNpZ24uZnFub3ZlbHBpYy5jb20vbm92ZWwtcGljL2VkZjI0YmI0OThiNTI3N2JjNGYxOWRiZjI0YjY5NDg5fnRwbHYtODFubXR3eWV5OS1zdXBlcnJlc28tYWlmaXQ6NDAwOjAuaGVpYz9sazNzPTY0NDc3ZTE2JngtZXhwaXJlcz0xNzk1NzcwMDU2Jngtc2lnbmF0dXJlPWNGYmFsR3lkUlFvWlVYN25lMWpORWhHN1V0byUzRHx8MTgyMjEyMjA1Nw\u0026s=3b90fd33cc84a1f4495749bc22ef66d0","intro":"怀孕后的林舒宜发现，曾经温柔体贴的丈夫秦宴礼，因为误会和沟通缺失，渐渐与她产生隔阂。面对生活中的委屈与婚姻里的变化，林舒宜一次次失望，也开始重新审视这段感情。随